  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_1044.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La Mancomunidad Espad&aacute;n-Mijares celebra este s&aacute;bado su d&iacute;a anual, en las instalaciones que la entidad supramunicipal que agrupa a 15 pueblos tiene en Tales. All&iacute; se pueden visitar paradas de los municipios, de comercios y de artesan&iacute;a. Tambi&eacute;n ha habido una comida de hemandad y para esta noche hay prevista una cena.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diamancomunitattales13/img_0964.jpg\" alt=\"img_0964\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diamancomunitattales13/img_0965.jpg\" alt=\"img_0965\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diamancomunitattales13/img_0966.jpg\" alt=\"img_0966\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diamancomunitattales13/img_0967.jpg\" alt=\"img_0967\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diamancomunitattales13/img_0968.jpg\" alt=\"img_0968\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diamancomunitattales13/img_0969.jpg\" alt=\"img_0969\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diamancomunitattales13/img_0970.jpg\" alt=\"img_0970\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diamancomunitattales13/img_0971.jpg\" alt=\"img_0971\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diamancomunitattales13/img_0972.jpg\" alt=\"img_0972\" styl